# `kernel_abi` is the kernel's exported C ABI: an rlib of `#[no_mangle]` thunks
# onto the logic crates' safe functions.  The kernel's single Rust archive is
# built by `Cact/kernel/kernel_link`, which scans this directory as part of the
# Rust graph.  Nothing to build here.
